.el .ds Aq '
.TH status 1  "status " 
.SH NAME
status \- Show accepted repository state and current draft status
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstatus\fR [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show accepted repository state and current draft status
.PP
Displays where the repository is right now: current accepted state summary plus active draft transaction status.
.PP
Machine JSON supported: \-\-json flag.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH "EVERYDAY WORKFLOW"
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
Display compact single\-line dashboard
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
